{
    "title": "Monster High\u2122 Beauty Salon",
    "description": "Oh, My, Ghoul!!! Your favorite fashionista doll dress up from the Monster High monster girls is here to dress up and look fangtastic: Frankie Stein\u2122, Draculaura\u2122, Clawdeen Wolf\u2122, Cleo de Nile\u2122, Lagoona Blue\u2122, Ari Hauntington\u2122, Silvi Timberwolf\u2122 and Twyla\u2122. All the fashion monster girls are ready for a fangtastic hair challenge makeover at the hair salon! Just pick the doll you like most and get started on her makeover through various beauty, doll dress up and makeup games.\r\n\r\nClawdeen Wolf\u2122, the trendiest fashionista monsterista doll dress up from \u201cMonster High\u201d just opened her very own fashion, beauty, dress up and hair salon - and she needs YOUR spooktacular makeover touch!\r\nHelp Clawdeen Wolf\u2122 give her ghoulfriends killer fashion makeover hair dye looks at the doll dress up hair salon!\r\nClawesome rainbow high hairdo? Creeperific acrylic nails? How about a new fangtastic fashion outfit from the beauty salon? You can get \u2019em all in the ghoulest one-stop shop!\r\n\r\nOh wait, that\u2019s not all: You can get freaky-fab fashionista doll looks by using our gore-geous selfie filters. You can even create your own filters, so get creative with that hair dye in the monster girls hair salon! Join us, makeup games fans, we have something special for you.\r\n\r\nFangtastic Features:\r\n> Enter the spooky-cool hair salon with the Monster High monster girl! Accept the hair challenge and use the perfect hairstyle tools, like magic growing spray, rainbow hair dye, mousse and so much more! You can even use Znap to electrify hair! If you are a hair games fan - we surely have something in store for you!\r\n> Get their acrylic nails done and give them a creeperific touch with all the designs available in our fabulous collection that you cannot find in other make up games!\r\n> Our selfie filter pack gives you monstrous doll looks, lets you dance like a Zomboy, AND you can create your own fangtastic filters too - how clawesome is that?!\r\n> Add your freaky fab fashionista photos to Spookygram to show off your killer looks and hairstyle.\r\n> Give the boo-tiful monsters the makeover of their nightmares, using the best makeup artist tools you\u2019ve ever laid your eyeballs on! Add lightning stickers and spider face jewels for an extra creepy cool touch.\r\n> Dress up time with Clawdeen Wolf\u2122 and the fashion ghoul gang! Mummy leggings or dresses fit for a rock star monster? The choices are endless like the colours of the rainbow! And wait till you see the crazy shoe collection!\r\n> Dress up and accessorize Draculaura\u2122 and the rest of your spooky fashionista Monster High monster girls with clawesome jewelry like crazy-shaped earrings or spiky collar necklaces.\r\n> Be a makeup artist and give makeup makeovers to all of the ghoulest monsters: Frankie Stein\u2122, Draculaura\u2122, Clawdeen Wolf\u2122, Cleo de Nile\u2122, Lagoona Blue\u2122, Ari Hauntington\u2122, Silvi Timberwolf\u2122 and Twyla\u2122\r\n\r\nMONSTER HIGH and associated trademarks and trade dress are owned by, and used under license from, Mattel. \u00a92017 Mattel. All rights reserved.\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
    "descriptionHTML": "Oh, My, Ghoul!!! Your favorite fashionista doll dress up from the Monster High monster girls is here to dress up and look fangtastic: Frankie Stein\u2122, Draculaura\u2122, Clawdeen Wolf\u2122, Cleo de Nile\u2122, Lagoona Blue\u2122, Ari Hauntington\u2122, Silvi Timberwolf\u2122 and Twyla\u2122. All the fashion monster girls are ready for a fangtastic hair challenge makeover at the hair salon! Just pick the doll you like most and get started on her makeover through various beauty, doll dress up and makeup games.<br><br>Clawdeen Wolf\u2122, the trendiest fashionista monsterista doll dress up from \u201cMonster High\u201d just opened her very own fashion, beauty, dress up and hair salon - and she needs YOUR spooktacular makeover touch!<br>Help Clawdeen Wolf\u2122 give her ghoulfriends killer fashion makeover hair dye looks at the doll dress up hair salon!<br>Clawesome rainbow high hairdo? Creeperific acrylic nails? How about a new fangtastic fashion outfit from the beauty salon? You can get \u2019em all in the ghoulest one-stop shop!<br><br>Oh wait, that\u2019s not all: You can get freaky-fab fashionista doll looks by using our gore-geous selfie filters. You can even create your own filters, so get creative with that hair dye in the monster girls hair salon! Join us, makeup games fans, we have something special for you.<br><br>Fangtastic Features:<br>&gt; Enter the spooky-cool hair salon with the Monster High monster girl! Accept the hair challenge and use the perfect hairstyle tools, like magic growing spray, rainbow hair dye, mousse and so much more! You can even use Znap to electrify hair! If you are a hair games fan - we surely have something in store for you!<br>&gt; Get their acrylic nails done and give them a creeperific touch with all the designs available in our fabulous collection that you cannot find in other make up games!<br>&gt; Our selfie filter pack gives you monstrous doll looks, lets you dance like a Zomboy, AND you can create your own fangtastic filters too - how clawesome is that?!<br>&gt; Add your freaky fab fashionista photos to Spookygram to show off your killer looks and hairstyle.<br>&gt; Give the boo-tiful monsters the makeover of their nightmares, using the best makeup artist tools you\u2019ve ever laid your eyeballs on! Add lightning stickers and spider face jewels for an extra creepy cool touch.<br>&gt; Dress up time with Clawdeen Wolf\u2122 and the fashion ghoul gang! Mummy leggings or dresses fit for a rock star monster? The choices are endless like the colours of the rainbow! And wait till you see the crazy shoe collection!<br>&gt; Dress up and accessorize Draculaura\u2122 and the rest of your spooky fashionista Monster High monster girls with clawesome jewelry like crazy-shaped earrings or spiky collar necklaces.<br>&gt; Be a makeup artist and give makeup makeovers to all of the ghoulest monsters: Frankie Stein\u2122, Draculaura\u2122, Clawdeen Wolf\u2122, Cleo de Nile\u2122, Lagoona Blue\u2122, Ari Hauntington\u2122, Silvi Timberwolf\u2122 and Twyla\u2122<br><br>MONSTER HIGH and associated trademarks and trade dress are owned by, and used under license from, Mattel. \u00a92017 Mattel. All rights reserved.<br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
